      - cell:
        - link "동영상 미리보기 이미지: Can You Hear a Silent Painting? | Music Without a Stage #KoreanCulture #korea #chosen " [ref=e51]
        - link "Can You Hear a Silent Painting? | Music Without a Stage #KoreanCulture #korea #chosen" [ref=e52]
        - text: "A concert does not always need a stage.\nTwo women sit close to a long wooden string instrument. Follow its body, its strings and the hands above them, and imagine a small musical moment inside a Korean room.\n\nThe painting is silent, yet the hands suggest music. Clothes alone cannot establish the figures' social position, and appearance alone does not identify the instrument. Look at the space between the figures and the window lines around them.\n\nCollection: APKC260507306 · Korean genre painting"
      - cell:
        - generic "—" [ref=e53]
      - cell:
        - generic "공개" [ref=e54]
      - cell "2026. 10. 27." [ref=e55]: "2026. 10. 27.\n     게시일"
      - cell "4" [ref=e56]
      - cell "동영상에 0개의 댓글이 있습니다. 동영상 댓글 페이지" [ref=e57]:
        - link "동영상에 0개의 댓글이 있습니다. 동영상 댓글 페이지" [ref=e58]: "0"
    - row:
