        - checkbox "Where Are the Dining Chairs? | A Korean Soban Table #KoreanCulture개 선택" [ref=e61]
      - cell:
        - link "동영상 미리보기 이미지: Where Are the Dining Chairs? | A Korean Soban Table #KoreanCulture 1:08" [ref=e62]
        - link "Where Are the Dining Chairs? | A Korean Soban Table #KoreanCulture" [ref=e63]
        - text: "A low table meets people seated on the floor.\nThis small Korean table is called a soban. It could hold a meal and carry dishes into a room. Moved away after use, it suited a room serving more than one purpose.\n\nLook at the height of the bowls, the hands and the seated bodies. This is one chosen scene rather than a picture of every household. A small piece of furniture helps us read the shape of a day.\n\nCollection: APKC260507306 · Korean genre painting, attributed to Uncho\nFrom the TJ KIM Collect"
      - cell:
        - generic "—" [ref=e64]
      - cell:
        - generic "공개" [ref=e65]
      - cell "2026. 10. 27." [ref=e66]: "2026. 10. 27.\n     게시일"
      - cell "30" [ref=e67]
      - cell "동영상에 0개의 댓글이 있습니다. 동영상 댓글 페이지" [ref=e68]:
        - link "동영상에 0개의 댓글이 있습니다. 동영상 댓글 페이지" [ref=e69]: "0"
    - row:
      - cell "A Rainy Day in Joseon Korea: Hats, Covers and Everyday Life #KoreanHistory개 선택" [ref=e70]:
        - checkbox "A Rainy Day in Joseon Korea: Hats, Covers and Everyday Life #KoreanHistory개 선택" [ref=e72]
      - cell:
        - link "동영상 미리보기 이미지: A Rainy Day in Joseon Korea: Hats, Covers and Everyday Life #KoreanHistory 1:08" [ref=e73]
        - link "A Rainy Day in Joseon Korea: Hats, Covers and Everyday Life #KoreanHistory" [ref=e74]
        - text: "Rain changes a street, but it does not stop the day.\nSome people shelter under a roof while others keep moving. Look at the broad hats and the covers over a carried load: clothing and everyday tools become ways to deal with the weather.\n\nBeyond the unfamiliar shapes are people working, resting and getting somewhere. This genre painting brings a rainy Korean street a little closer.\n\nCollection item: APKC260507306 · genre painting attributed to Uncho\nFrom the TJ Kim Collection\nMusic: Flow Music, \""
      - cell:
