      - cell:
        - link "동영상 미리보기 이미지: A Meal Along the Road: A Food Shop in Joseon Korea #KoreanHistory 1:08" [ref=e84]
        - link "A Meal Along the Road: A Food Shop in Joseon Korea #KoreanHistory" [ref=e85]
        - text: "What can a meal on the road tell us about daily life in Korea?\nUnder a thatched roof, people prepare and sell food. Bowls sit close to customers, while a carrier balances a broad tray on her head.\n\nThe exact dishes and type of shop cannot be identified from this picture alone. Follow the hands preparing food and the body carrying it: an unfamiliar shop becomes a place of familiar human effort.\n\nCollection item: APKC260507306 · genre painting attributed to Uncho\nFrom the TJ Kim Collection\nMusic:"
      - cell:
        - generic "—" [ref=e86]
      - cell:
        - generic "비공개" [ref=e87]
      - cell "2026. 10. 26." [ref=e88]: "2026. 10. 26.\n     업로드됨"
